# GREP_SUMMARY: hermes-agent config empty placeholder .gitkeep
# STRUCTURE: empty directory — no default configs in base-layer; context-layer overlay populates at deploy
# region MODULE_CONTRACT
## @purpose  Empty placeholder directory for hermes-agent config files
## @scope    Base-layer — holds no configs. Context-layer overlay (node-configs) populates at deploy time.
## @invariants
##   - Directory must exist for Docker COPY to succeed even when overlay has no configs
##   - .gitkeep preserves the empty dir in git
##   - Actual configs come from node-configs/overlays/hermes-agent/config/ via multi-stage overlay
## @rationale Base-layer must provide the skeleton directory so Dockerfile COPY overlays/ never fails
# endregion MODULE_CONTRACT
